jane mushkil kusha jane zehra hussain<br>
aye gareeb ul watan tashnalab ya hussain<br>
<br>
1.kaichi akbar ke seene se barchi juhi<br>
tar hua khoon mein ham shabe he nabi<br>
phir who kadiyal jawan ka tadapna hussain<br>
<br>
2.khoon mein oun o mohammad naha e hue<br>
lashe dono ke qaime mein lae gaye<br>
aise alam mein maa ka tha sajda hussain<br>
<br>
3.muntashir ran mein farwa ka noor e nazar<br>
lash qasim ki thi ya hassan ka jigar<br>
bewa kubra ko deh kaise pursa hussain<br>
<br>
4.gurz sar par laga aankh mein teer tha<br>
hoke bedsat ghazi zameen par gira<br>
woh kamar thamkar tera girya hussain<br>
<br>
5.nanhi gardan pa pyase ki teer e sitam<br>
tere hato pa nikla hai asghar ka dam<br>
maa ki nazro mein hai khali jhoola hussain<br>
<br>
6.ek din mein tera jab bhara ghar luta<br>
gham ke jangal mein jab tu akela hua<br>
tujpa charo taraf se tha hamla hussain<br>
<br>
7.jab gale tere kund khanjar chala<br>
bain zainab ke thay bhai mara gaya<br>
teri dukyari maa ka tadapna hussain<br>
<br>
8.jab hua mustafa ka nawasa shaheed<br>
ek qayamath hui karbala mein rasheed<br>
har taraf goonj ti thi sada ya hussain